  "body": "The legend needs to take the fieldset's padding into account, somehow. How? Is it added to the legend's margin?\r\n\r\nCurrently the fieldset itself has a used value of padding that is 0, and the padding inherits into the fieldset anonymous content box. But the anonymous box's padding doesn't affect the legend?\r\n\r\ncc @whatwg/fieldset ",
